# ⚠️ REMOVE THIS FILE AT DNS CUTOVER (brief §64)
# While the site lives on a *.workers.dev staging URL it must stay out of Google —
# otherwise the staging copy competes with the real domain for the same content.
# Deleting this file is the last step before go-live.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# Security headers — these stay permanently.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
